    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h1>📚 Cross-Reference Reality</h1><p><em>(6th Level)</em></p><p><strong>Noise:</strong> +1</p><p><em>“This pattern is documented.”</em></p><p>You may link two or more active Precedents as supporting evidence.</p><p>By spending <strong>Surge</strong>, you may:</p><ul><li><p>Extend a Precedent’s influence to an analogous target</p></li><li><p>Impose roll 3d10 keep lowest 2 on actions that contradict multiple records</p></li><li><p>Propagate a recorded aspect into a similar scenario</p></li></ul><p>The more aligned the pattern, the stronger the enforcement.</p><h3>Cost</h3><p>Spend 1 Surge.</p><h3>Pushback</h3><p>Aggressive cross-referencing increases <strong>Noise</strong>, especially when used to override player agency or freeze evolving situations.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
